<h2>Quick verdict</h2>
<p>Zendesk and Freshdesk both turn customer requests into tickets, but their plan structures differ. Zendesk is worth a close look for structured ticket workflows and a wider service suite. Freshdesk is worth comparing when Growth, Pro or Enterprise fits your support process and the team wants to check its channel and AI needs against published annual seat prices.</p>
<p>Freshdesk Growth and Zendesk Support Team were both listed at US$19 per agent/month billed yearly when their official pricing pages were checked on October 29, 2026. The next tiers differ, so the starting price alone is not enough to choose.</p>
